{
  "name": "Google News & GDELT Daily Brand & Sentiment Tone Monitor -> Google Sheets & Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-news-daily",
      "name": "Daily 08:00 Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/yannabadie~google-news-gdelt-api-mcp/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{$env.APIFY_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"mode\": \"combined\",\n  \"query\": \"artificial intelligence\",\n  \"language\": \"en\",\n  \"country\": \"US\",\n  \"when\": \"1d\",\n  \"includeToneChart\": true,\n  \"maxResults\": 25\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-news-call",
      "name": "Fetch Google News + GDELT Articles",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "only-articles",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.recordType}}",
              "rightValue": "article",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "has-title",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.title}}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-news-articles",
      "name": "Keep Deduplicated News Articles",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "sentiment-badge",
              "name": "sentimentBadge",
              "value": "={{($json.toneLabel || 'neutral').toUpperCase()}} ({{$json.tone !== null && $json.tone !== undefined ? $json.tone : 'N/A'}})",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "id": "set-sentiment-tag",
      "name": "Tag Sentiment Tone",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        920,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "News_Sentiment_Monitor",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "recordKey": "={{$json.recordKey}}",
            "provider": "={{$json.provider}}",
            "publishedAt": "={{$json.publishedAt}}",
            "source": "={{$json.source}}",
            "domain": "={{$json.domain}}",
            "title": "={{$json.title}}",
            "tone": "={{$json.tone}}",
            "toneLabel": "={{$json.toneLabel}}",
            "sourceCountry": "={{$json.sourceCountry}}",
            "url": "={{$json.url}}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "recordKey"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sheets-news-upsert",
      "name": "Upsert Articles to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1180,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$env.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL}}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"text\": \"Media Alert [{{$json.provider}} | {{$json.sentimentBadge}}]: *{{$json.title}}*\\nSource: {{$json.source || $json.domain || 'Unknown'}} ({{$json.publishedAt || 'recent'}})\\nLink: {{$json.url}}\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "slack-news-alert",
      "name": "Send Brand Sentiment Alert to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1180,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily Google News RSS + GDELT v2 Brand Monitor\n1. Set n8n env vars `APIFY_TOKEN` and `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`.\n2. Edit `query`, `language`, `country`, and `when` (`1d`, `7d`) in **Fetch Google News + GDELT Articles**.\n3. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` and run once manually before activating.",
        "height": 195,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-news-setup",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Media Intelligence & Tone Tagging\n- **Keep Deduplicated News Articles** separates article rows from summary records.\n- **Tag Sentiment Tone** formats GDELT `toneLabel` + numeric tone score for Slack triage.\n- **Upsert** deduplicates on `recordKey` across daily runs.",
        "height": 175,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-news-output",
      "name": "Deduplication & Sentiment Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        40
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 08:00 Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch Google News + GDELT Articles",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch Google News + GDELT Articles": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Keep Deduplicated News Articles",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Keep Deduplicated News Articles": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Tag Sentiment Tone",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Tag Sentiment Tone": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upsert Articles to Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Send Brand Sentiment Alert to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "instanceId": "yannabadie-news-gdelt-template-v1"
  }
}
